Package: mytical-session
Version: 0.1.0-1~resolute1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mytical <dev@mytical.invalid>
Depends: mytical-sddm-theme, sddm, xserver-xorg, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, gnome-keyring, gvfs, polkitd
Conflicts: ubuntu-session, gdm3
Description: Mytical Hyprland session entry and wrapper
 Installs the single Mytical Wayland session, its /usr/bin wrapper and
 SDDM's session/theme configuration. It does not ship a compositor: in the
 Preview the wrapper finds Hyprland in the Nix profile; in the ISO it finds
 the APT package.
